"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/extras/87760b3cd7693f8fcde55315e403e384.poster.avif?t=1757093617\" width=630 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/extras/87760b3cd7693f8fcde55315e403e384.webm?t=1757093617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/extras/87760b3cd7693f8fcde55315e403e384.mp4?t=1757093617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/extras/4cc86ecf1406cbb96e6601a34b83c871.poster.avif?t=1757093617\" width=664 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/extras/4cc86ecf1406cbb96e6601a34b83c871.webm?t=1757093617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/extras/4cc86ecf1406cbb96e6601a34b83c871.mp4?t=1757093617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/extras/49b724dcd479f49484c5d70015ae8f39.poster.avif?t=1757093617\" width=600 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/extras/49b724dcd479f49484c5d70015ae8f39.webm?t=1757093617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/extras/49b724dcd479f49484c5d70015ae8f39.mp4?t=1757093617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/extras/f73d4c50b429407a477ed90530e13907.avif?t=1757093617\" width=600 height=89 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/extras/1743eab0c98ea3d0bb5596c5375e405f.poster.avif?t=1757093617\" width=774 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/extras/1743eab0c98ea3d0bb5596c5375e405f.webm?t=1757093617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/extras/1743eab0c98ea3d0bb5596c5375e405f.mp4?t=1757093617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/extras/d300ae1c58c1a88357022074bc274ac6.poster.avif?t=1757093617\" width=518 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/extras/d300ae1c58c1a88357022074bc274ac6.webm?t=1757093617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/extras/d300ae1c58c1a88357022074bc274ac6.mp4?t=1757093617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/extras/ba10ac75b9c1679cfdf313d7083ac161.poster.avif?t=1757093617\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/extras/ba10ac75b9c1679cfdf313d7083ac161.webm?t=1757093617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/extras/ba10ac75b9c1679cfdf313d7083ac161.mp4?t=1757093617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What Makes Battle Charge Special?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Cinematic Tactical Combat \u2013 We\u2019re mixing real-time third-person action with squad commands. You\u2019re not just swinging a sword\u2014you\u2019re leading a charge, flanking enemies, and holding shieldwalls under a rain of arrows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Shieldwall System \u2013 Not just decorative. Our troops react to charges, brace for impact, and follow player commands like \u201cpush\u201d or \u201chold.\u201d It\u2019s about timing and pressure, not just button-mashing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Traps &amp; Ambushes \u2013 Set trap holes, time your flaming arrow ambush, or launch a surprise ballista strike mid-battle. It\u2019s chaos\u2014but the kind you plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Charge &amp; Defend Loop \u2013 You\u2019re not always on the offensive. Each mission has an attack and a defense phase. Win the charge, then hold your ground for the next wave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Playable Companions (Co-Op Ready) \u2013 Friends can jump in as your companions in co-op mode (in the works). For now, powerful AI companions fight alongside you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- No Giant Armies, Just Grit \u2013 Instead of 1000 units you can barely control, we focused on small-scale, gritty battles where every decision counts. About 50 vs 50 in scale\u2014enough for mayhem, but still readable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- known comparison \u2013 We\u2019re not going full fantasy, but we\u2019re also not tied to historical accuracy. Think Bannerlord meets Conqueror\u2019s Blade with our own flair.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1973420?t=1757093617","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757093617","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/6c5e755de47d6d1fc33fb114b01ff6f0cecb9a53/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757093617","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/6c5e755de47d6d1fc33fb114b01ff6f0cecb9a53/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757093617","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game is about a war at medieval times. So sword fighting and killing is present. there will visual elements such as blood, dying and fighting."},"detailed_description":"<h1>Steam Greenlight</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1757093617\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1757093617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1757093617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Battle Charge is a 3rd person medieval RPG game where you command your troops against the enemy in battlefield. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the cinematic battle scenes of Vikings, The Last Kingdom, Braveheart, Barbarians and others, it is time to have a medieval battle game where you can experience the trilling moments of those army clashes. There will be features like shield wall tactics, traps and ambushes, loyal companions and various types of troops with different weapons and skills. This will help you choose your strategy and tactics in every battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers Single player and co-op multiplayer where your friends can play as your companion in the battlefield. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Charge is your gateway to living out the epic scenes that have captivated audiences. Stay tuned for updates. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/extras/37785c06f0c336f8dba31f1ed239f9f5.avif?t=1757093617\" width=600 height=89 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/extras/30cb3f4781bf85790acae9689a11e435.poster.avif?t=1757093617\" width=600 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/extras/30cb3f4781bf85790acae9689a11e435.webm?t=1757093617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/extras/30cb3f4781bf85790acae9689a11e435.mp4?t=1757093617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/extras/f0f2c7670db3399ec7a8ad2b387a1d2e.poster.avif?t=1757093617\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/extras/f0f2c7670db3399ec7a8ad2b387a1d2e.webm?t=1757093617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/extras/f0f2c7670db3399ec7a8ad2b387a1d2e.mp4?t=1757093617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/extras/1314743cc5975744dc255500a760d77a.poster.avif?t=1757093617\" width=794 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/extras/1314743cc5975744dc255500a760d77a.webm?t=1757093617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/extras/1314743cc5975744dc255500a760d77a.mp4?t=1757093617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/extras/d9106855571ba5b953780e689faef964.avif?t=1757093617\" width=600 height=89 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/extras/87760b3cd7693f8fcde55315e403e384.poster.avif?t=1757093617\" width=630 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/extras/87760b3cd7693f8fcde55315e403e384.webm?t=1757093617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/extras/87760b3cd7693f8fcde55315e403e384.mp4?t=1757093617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/extras/4cc86ecf1406cbb96e6601a34b83c871.poster.avif?t=1757093617\" width=664 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/extras/4cc86ecf1406cbb96e6601a34b83c871.webm?t=1757093617\" type=\"video/webm; co