mai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/extras/d300ae1c58c1a88357022074bc274ac6.webm?t=1757093617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/extras/d300ae1c58c1a88357022074bc274ac6.mp4?t=1757093617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/extras/ba10ac75b9c1679cfdf313d7083ac161.poster.avif?t=1757093617\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/extras/ba10ac75b9c1679cfdf313d7083ac161.webm?t=1757093617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/extras/ba10ac75b9c1679cfdf313d7083ac161.mp4?t=1757093617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What Makes Battle Charge Special?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Cinematic Tactical Combat \u2013 We\u2019re mixing real-time third-person action with squad commands. You\u2019re not just swinging a sword\u2014you\u2019re leading a charge, flanking enemies, and holding shieldwalls under a rain of arrows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Shieldwall System \u2013 Not just decorative. Our troops react to charges, brace for impact, and follow player commands like \u201cpush\u201d or \u201chold.\u201d It\u2019s about timing and pressure, not just button-mashing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Traps &amp; Ambushes \u2013 Set trap holes, time your flaming arrow ambush, or launch a surprise ballista strike mid-battle. It\u2019s chaos\u2014but the kind you plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Charge &amp; Defend Loop \u2013 You\u2019re not always on the offensive. Each mission has an attack and a defense phase. Win the charge, then hold your ground for the next wave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Playable Companions (Co-Op Ready) \u2013 Friends can jump in as your companions in co-op mode (in the works). For now, powerful AI companions fight alongside you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- No Giant Armies, Just Grit \u2013 Instead of 1000 units you can barely control, we focused on small-scale, gritty battles where every decision counts. About 50 vs 50 in scale\u2014enough for mayhem, but still readable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- known comparison \u2013 We\u2019re not going full fantasy, but we\u2019re also not tied to historical accuracy. Think Bannerlord meets Conqueror\u2019s Blade with our own flair.</p>","developers":["LavGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973420/header.jpg?t=1757093617","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1973420/463100341/8b5df4bdc1c3688432716d180dcb9b6bee0cc588/1751063009/dash_av1.mpd?t=1746855460","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1973420/463100341/8b5df4bdc1c3688432716d180dcb9b6bee0cc588/1751063009/dash_h264.mpd?t=1746855460","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1973420/463100341/8b5df4bdc1c3688432716d180dcb9b6bee0cc588/1751063009/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1746855460","id":256884969,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256884969/movie480.mp4?t=1746855460","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256884969/movie_max.mp4?t=1746855460"},"name":"Battle Charge Gameplay Trailer 2025","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256884969/082b2366e81c387c5ff7ca31604fb22e6f84d793/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746855460","webm":{"480":"http